93
00:09:43,001 --> 00:09:44,201
Bagaimana kalau kutukar dengan emas?

94
00:09:45,876 --> 00:09:47,500
Aku punya pasukan 33 pemanah jitu,

95
00:09:47,501 --> 00:09:48,959
